@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed lightweight scenario-based trade-off evaluation
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Identify source status, owner goals and actual constraints;
:Define stimulus / environment / artifact / response / measure;
:Compare candidate mechanisms and alternatives;\nrecord assumptions and cross-attribute costs;
if (Targets and safe evaluation prerequisites ready?) then (yes)
 :Evaluate actual identified candidate under controlled workload;\nretain failures, raw measures and limits;
 :Compare exact criterion and reviewed target;\nrecord risks, sensitivities and trade-off findings;
else (no)
 :Record missing target / mechanism / enabling evidence;\nprepare bounded next investigation;
endif
:Obtain scoped disposition through existing authority;
if (Evidence supports the required outcome?) then (yes)
 :Record actual candidate / result / accepted scope;\nretain residual risks and operating obligations;
else (no / unknown)
 :Revise mechanism or explicit target/resource/scope proposal;\nnever invent a Pass or silently drop capability;
endif
stop
@enduml
